# Ownership & contract-first

## Resolve who you are helping

1. Read `.cursor/local/IDENTITY.md` if present (gitignored).
2. Else use the engineer named in the user message.
3. Else ask once: which engineer (TN/VV/SV/VB/RM/VG)?
4. For role depth, open **`TEAM.md`** (their §) and **`docs/delivery/ENGINEER_GUIDES.md`** (their §). Do not assume Vishal V.

Quick map: `.cursor/kb/ownership.md`.

## Ownership (TEAM.md / CODEOWNERS — authoritative)

| Owner | Initials | Owns |
|---|---|---|
| Tino | TN | contracts, ADRs, CI, delivery docs — **no feature code**; mandatory reviewer |
| Vishal V | VV | platform, auth, users, rate-limit, sandbox, prisma, infra, scripts, observability, load-tests |
| Satheswaran V | SV | ui, api-client, web-student, web-tpo, e2e |
